  "2026-06-03T05:45:01.575Z",codex,"DONE. The documented --no-preflight-network escape hatch was UNUSABLE: it was read in preflight but never declared as a command flag, AND pm strips '--no-' as boolean negation. Fixed by declaring '--skip-preflight-network' (preflight reads both new + legacy keys for back-compat). Verified accepted on 'linear sync' with clean USAGE on missing key."
